{"unit_id": "tag:0GN7:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。定义<REF_0001>中的每个函子（functors）<MATH_0003>\n<MATHSEG_0001>或<MATHSEG_0002>\n都是全忠实（fully faithful）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形。"}, {"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "两类拟凝聚模的函子。"}, {"source_term": "fully faithful", "target_term": "全忠实", "context": "函子的性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:0GN7:proof", "translation": "（由引理<REF_0001>，我们确实得到所示的函子（functors）。）我们可以并且确实将<MATH_0002>上的<MATH_0001>-模（modules）与<MATH_0003>上的模（modules）等同。拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent modules）<MATH_0005>上的函子（functor）<MATH_0004>由赋环（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>的拉回（pullback）给出，见注记<REF_0002>。在每种情形中，函子（functor）<MATH_0007>由沿包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0008>或<MATH_0009>的限制（restriction）给出（关于如何定义这些景（sites）的态射（morphisms），见拓扑（Topologies）中的第<REF_0003>节的讨论）。结合<MATH_0010>的描述，我们看到，只要<MATH_0012>是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，就有<MATH_0011>。于是我们看到<MATH_0013>，如所欲。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent modules", "target_term": "拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "ringed", "target_term": "赋环"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functors", "target_term": "函子", "context": "构造得到的函子。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "景或拓扑斯上的模。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent modules", "target_term": "拟凝聚模", "context": "被拉回的模。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "拉回与限制函子。"}, {"source_term": "ringed", "target_term": "赋环", "context": "景具有结构环层。"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "赋环景与小景。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "赋环景的态射。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "沿景态射的拉回。"}, {"source_term": "inclusion functor", "target_term": "包含函子", "context": "小景进入大景。"}, {"source_term": "restriction", "target_term": "限制", "context": "沿包含函子的限制。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "景态射的定义。"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "使所述等式成立的模性质。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03DX:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 函子（functor）<MATH_0003>定义了范畴等价（equivalence of categories）<MATH_0004>，它联系<MATH_0005>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的范畴（category）与<MATH_0008>的大（big）<MATH_0007>景（site）上的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 设<MATH_0009>或<MATH_0010>。函子（functor）<MATH_0011>定义了范畴等价（equivalence of categories）<MATH_0012>，它联系<MATH_0013>上的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）的范畴（category）与<MATH_0016>的小（small）<MATH_0015>景（site）上的拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0014>-模（modules）的范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "small", "target_term": "小"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "从小层构造大层。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "命题给出的等价。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "概形