{"unit_id": "tag:05VG:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是景上的模（Modules on Sites）中的定义<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>中定义的模（modules）的性质之一<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>列表为：自由（free）、有限自由（finite free）、由整体截面（global sections）生成（generated）、由<MATH_0004>个整体截面（global sections）生成（generated）、由有限多个（finitely many）整体截面（global sections）生成（generated）、具有整体表示（global presentation）、具有整体有限表示（global finite presentation）、局部自由（locally free）、有限局部自由（finite locally free）、局部由截面生成（locally generated by sections）、局部（locally）由<MATH_0005>个截面（sections）生成（generated）、有限型（finite type）、有限表示（finite presentation）、凝聚（coherent）或平坦（flat）。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>按照命题<REF_0004>中所见的规则<MATH_0006>定义的范畴（categories）等价（equivalences）\n<MATHSEG_0001>与<MATHSEG_0002>\n具有性质\n<MATHSEG_0003>具有<MATHSEG_0004>具有<MATHSEG_0005>作为一个<MATHSEG_0006>-模（module）<MATHSEG_0007>\n但当<MATH_0007>是“局部自由（locally free）”或“凝聚（coherent）”时（可能）例外。若<MATH_0008>“凝聚（coherent）”，则当<MATH_0010>是局部诺特（locally Noetherian）的且<MATH_0011>为扎里斯基（Zariski）或平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）时，此等价（equivalence）对于<MATH_0009>成立。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "free", "target_term": "自由"}, {"source_term": "finite free", "target_term": "有限自由"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "global presentation", "target_term": "整体表示"}, {"source_term": "global finite presentation", "target_term": "整体有限表示"}, {"source_term": "locally free", "target_term": "局部自由"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成"}, {"source_term": "locally", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite presentation", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "coherent", "target_term": "凝聚"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalences", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "locally free", "target_term": "局部自由"}, {"source_term": "coherent", "target_term": "凝聚"}, {"source_term": "coherent", "target_term": "凝聚"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "Zariski", "target_term": "扎里斯基"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形。"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "所列性质的对象。"}, {"source_term": "free", "target_term": "自由", "context": "模性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite free", "target_term": "有限自由", "context": "模性质。"}, {"source_term": "global sections", "target_term": "整体截面", "context": "模的全局生成元。"}, {"source_term": "generated", "target_term": "生成", "context": "截面生成模。"}, {"source_term": "finitely many", "target_term": "有限多个", "context": "生成元数量。"}, {"source_term": "global presentation", "target_term": "整体表示", "context": "模表示的性质。"}, {"source_term": "global finite presentation", "target_term": "整体有限表示", "context": "有限整体表示。"}, {"source_term": "locally free", "target_term": "局部自由", "context": "模的局部性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite locally free", "target_term": "有限局部自由", "context": "有限局部自由模。"}, {"source_term": "locally generated by sections", "target_term": "局部由截面生成", "context":