{"unit_id": "tag:05VG:proof", "translation": "对整体（global）性质，即景上的模（Modules on Sites）中的定义<REF_0001>中定义的性质，这直接成立。对于局部（local）性质，我们可以使用景上的模（Modules on Sites）中的引理<REF_0002>，将“<MATH_0001>具有<MATH_0002>”转化为<MATH_0003>的一个覆盖（covering）的成员上的性质。因此，结果由引理<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>、<REF_0006>和<REF_0007>得出。拟凝聚模（quasi-coherent module）的凝聚性（coherent）等同于在一个局部诺特（locally Noetherian）概形（scheme）上为有限型（finite type）（见概形的上同调（Cohomology of Schemes）中的引理<REF_0008>），因此这归结为有限型（finite type）模（modules）的情形（细节省略）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "global", "target_term": "整体"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent module", "target_term": "拟凝聚模"}, {"source_term": "coherent", "target_term": "凝聚性"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形的上同调"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "global", "target_term": "整体", "context": "整体定义的模性质。"}, {"source_term": "Modules on Sites", "target_term": "景上的模", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "local", "target_term": "局部", "context": "局部模性质。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "在覆盖成员上判定性质。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent module", "target_term": "拟凝聚模", "context": "凝聚性判定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "coherent", "target_term": "凝聚性", "context": "模的凝聚性质。"}, {"source_term": "locally Noetherian", "target_term": "局部诺特", "context": "底概形条件。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "模有限生成性质。"}, {"source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_