{"unit_id": "tag:03FJ:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的一个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）。设<MATH_0004>、<MATH_0005>、<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>如引理<REF_0001>中所述。则存在复形（complexes）的一个同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0008>（见第<REF_0002>节），其中<MATH_0009>、<MATH_0010>，且<MATH_0011>是一个忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环映射（ring map）。特别地，对所有<MATH_0013>，有<MATH_0012>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "complexes", "target_term": "复形"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "所给层。"}, {"source_term": "complexes", "target_term": "复形", "context": "被比较的复形。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "复形同构。"}, {"source_term": "faithfully flat", "target_term": "忠实平坦", "context": "环映射性质。"}, {"source_term": "ring map", "target_term": "环映射", "context": "覆盖对应的环映射。"}], "notes": []}
